 /// both full and auto-height editors compute wrap widths consistently.
+/// Zeo: the runs of consecutive rows painted by a highlight that carries a left border, as
+/// `start..end` with `end` exclusive, top to bottom. A run ends where the next row is not the
+/// following one or its highlight differs, as the Full-mode painter groups them.
+fn bordered_row_runs(
+    rows: &BTreeMap<DisplayRow, LineHighlight>,
+) -> Vec<(Range<DisplayRow>, LineHighlight)> {
